WEBVTT

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:33.240
Now, go on... defeat me.

00:01:35.010 --> 00:01:40.260
Magical Girl Ore will be an idol 
talked about for ages to come.

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:45.750
<b>Magical Girl - Watashi</b>

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:50.480
There's too many of them...

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:52.020
But...

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:54.360
I know that Saki is fighting beyond here.

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:56.930
Even if I can't see Saki herself...

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.520
we're still fighting together!

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:10.190
<b>Final Boss Chamber Here</b>

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.560
Come at me, demons.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.190
My Love Power is still strong!

00:02:10.750 --> 00:02:13.830
For the sake of love, we won't
 bend! We won't break!

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:16.300
We won't fall to anyone!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.900
Don't worry!

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:26.010
It's true we're gonna have 
a big fight after this,

00:02:26.010 --> 00:02:27.950
but I'm not all that tough.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:31.340
I'm afraid I won't have 
any flashy evolution,

00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:34.120
a three-phase battle, or "an actual 
<i>actual</i> true form reveal"...

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:38.850
So just beat me down as hard as you want.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:43.170
It's my job to make you 
guys a success, after all.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.560
What's wrong?

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:01.930
You're not empathizing with me, are you?

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.270
I'll have to give you an even greater
 reason to defeat me, then.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.410
Stop that!

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.740
Don't hurt Mohiro-chan!

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:19.600
Getting to be a magical girl's 
nemesis is like a dream for me!

00:03:20.130 --> 00:03:25.520
And any fan wants to see his favorite 
idol looking cool, you know?

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:30.500
If you care about me at all, you should 
let me watch you beat the bad guy.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:45.540
Why can't you understand?

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:52.040
All right.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:56.280
I'm so glad.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:58.140
You're such a professional!

00:04:06.090 --> 00:04:08.130
W-Wait a minute! What are you doing?!

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.370
That hurt!

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:23.300
That hurts! That hurts!

00:04:23.300 --> 00:04:26.770
It hurts in a major, but totally non-fatal way!

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:37.520
It's true... the reason we 
became famous as idols...

00:04:38.350 --> 00:04:40.220
is because we're magical girls.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:43.950
But dragging unrelated people into it...

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.100
Hurting the people we care about...

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:50.440
That's not the kind of idol I wanted to be!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:56.550
A hero who does that isn't a real hero!

00:04:58.330 --> 00:05:02.340
Why can't you understand that?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:14.280
Saki-chan... that hurts.

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:20.220
Saki-chan. Idols need to maintain 
dignified expressions.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:30.650
Manager, you idiot!

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.660
I can't forgive what you've done...

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:35.680
And I do want to save everyone...

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:39.370
But... but, but...

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:43.810
I don't wanna fight you!

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.330
You don't have a choice.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.510
When I kicked off this plan,

00:05:51.510 --> 00:05:56.040
I gave up my place in both 
the human and demon worlds.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:57.670
<b>Director</b>

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.380
<b>Director</b>

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.290
<b>Hurrr...</b>

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:00.290
<b>Lovely Poem</b>

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.840
Due to budget cuts, please pay any
 expenses <b>out of pocket</b> from now on.
❤Demon World❤

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:01.840
<b>Remaining funds</b>

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:03.380
Lalayu Pro, Inc
Management Division
Idol Manager
<b>Yamo Konami</b>

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:18.730
Final Notice
There is an issue with your mission achievements and 
attitude. If you do not show immediate improvement,
 we will consider termination.
❤Demon World❤

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:33.370
This is all I can do for you.

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:56.520
Manager!

00:07:13.460 --> 00:07:14.600
What the...

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:28.010
Mohiro-chan!

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:29.710
Are you okay?

00:07:34.750 --> 00:07:36.010
Why?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.840
"I wanted to be useful to you.

00:07:56.840 --> 00:08:00.330
Just as you're always protecting me,

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:03.880
I wanted to protect the 
person important to you."

00:08:05.620 --> 00:08:06.460
<i>Again...</i>

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:08.780
<i>It happened again.</i>

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.910
<i>Mohiro-chan saved me again.</i>

00:08:14.030 --> 00:08:17.140
You're wrong... I didn't do anything.

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:20.520
I haven't done anything this whole time...

00:08:24.070 --> 00:08:25.550
"That's not true."

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:31.980
"Time after time, you've thrown yourself 
into danger to save everyone."

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.780
"That's enough."

00:08:36.590 --> 00:08:38.890
"There's no doubt in my 
mind. Magical Girl Ore...

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.830
You're my hero."

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:48.070
Mohiro-chan...

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:56.260
Okay, that's quite enough of that!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:59.250
Magical girls are forbidden from impure 
relations with the opposite sex!

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:03.840
I came here to save you, but 
it seems I wasn't needed.

00:09:05.850 --> 00:09:08.970
I showed 'em all here, dammit!

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:15.090
And after I used underhanded means to
 connect this place to the fairy world...

00:09:15.090 --> 00:09:18.520
I arrived to find this.

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:22.820
That stuff is seriously not 
okay in our business, get it?

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.720
Mohiro. Sorry for the wait.

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.720
What's Hyoe doing here?

00:09:40.490 --> 00:09:44.620
Wait... has he not grasped 
the situation yet?

00:09:44.620 --> 00:09:46.060
It seems not.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:49.540
Even I'm starting to worry about him, now...

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.580
How oblivious can you get?

00:09:52.320 --> 00:09:53.480
Anyway...

00:09:55.750 --> 00:10:00.320
I'm putting you under arrest for 
the crime of invading other worlds.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.080
I can't believe it ends this way...

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:08.220
Sorry to interrupt you 
during your big moment,

00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:14.320
but you made such a scene that
 the fairy world had to get involved.

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.530
Take him into custody.

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.090
Yessir.

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:37.710
What's goin' on here?

00:10:38.530 --> 00:10:39.690
Don't tell me...

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.430
Sorry, Saki.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:11:00.060
I couldn't protect you... by... myself...

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:08.800
<b>Final Boss Chamber Here</b>

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.700
Sakuyo!

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:41.180
We need to go save Sakuyo!

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.570
I'd like to let you go... 
but I don't think I can.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.800
Konami-san. What orders 
did you give the demons?

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:56.360
Oh. I ordered them to attack the 
magical girls without killing them.

00:11:56.890 --> 00:12:00.480
But the cannon fodder demons 
shouldn't be that powerful anyway.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:04.950
Strictly speaking, demons are 
magical lifeforms, right?

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:10.020
Yes. Their learning capacity is just 
a copy of the first generation,

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.110
so they can't get any stronger.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:23.500
But the magical girls were defeating so many 
demons that I had to speed up their respawn rate.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:29.550
All life forms have a 
self-preservation instinct.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:33.260
Defeated demons are broken down 
to component parts and recreated.

00:12:33.610 --> 00:12:37.030
But what if, bit by bit, that led to 
the production of a transfer factor

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:41.060
which caused the "defeat magical girls" 
mission to propagate inside them?

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:42.690
It's possible.

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:45.210
I have no idea what you're talking about!

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.700
In other words, they had to respawn so fast

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.220
that information from previous generations 
got left behind as junk code.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.040
And this is the result?

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.500
Yes. It's led them to the 
realization that they could

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:02.090
preserve their own existence 
by defeating the magical girls.

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:05.590
And that's why they've locked us in here?

00:13:05.910 --> 00:13:08.920
Locking Uno Saki in here 
serves a purpose, too.

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:13.930
Separating the two of them increases 
the demons' chance of success.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.440
Oh, no!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:22.840
Kokoro. How many soldiers do you have?

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:25.690
Thirteen, myself included.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:28.200
Then there's me, Uno Saki, and...

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.850
Let's pretend we don't see that, and...

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.060
You'll fight with us, won't you?

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:37.290
Manager?

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:40.420
Yes, of course.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:44.840
No one wants to see magical girls 
taken down by cannon fodder demons.

00:13:46.220 --> 00:13:48.220
<b>300 demons (Reproduction Capable)</b>

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.220
<b>The Hyoe Squad</b>

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:54.150
Get 'em, ya bastards!

00:14:23.440 --> 00:14:26.890
What's going on? We're not thinning 
out their numbers at all...

00:14:27.460 --> 00:14:30.470
They may have also learned more
 efficient methods of regenerating.

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:32.530
What do you mean, "may have"?

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:33.980
You're their boss, aren't you?

00:14:34.320 --> 00:14:36.460
A boss with no authority.

00:14:38.880 --> 00:14:40.050
Mohiro-chan...

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.970
It doesn't matter how 
many of them there are.

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:47.150
I won't bend or break until it's done!

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.490
That's my motto!

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:05.920
Is that...

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.040
Hey, made it just in time!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:12.080
I can't leave everything to you young folk.

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:14.570
We wanted to grab a little spotlight!

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:17.360
That's a really cool line.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.160
It almost makes me forget 
how you dragged your feet

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:22.180
on entering the interdimensional passage.

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.740
Shut up! You shut your mouth, Ruka!

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:27.310
Sakuyo!

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.660
Leave them to us.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:35.860
You close out the show!

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:38.270
Got it.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.190
Let's go, Sakuyo!

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.500
Okay, Saki!

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:54.290
Love Power Ultimate Super 
Dangerous Final Episode:

00:15:54.290 --> 00:16:00.080
Rainbow Miracle Super Delicious Pretty 
Hyper Love Power Max Special!

00:16:01.550 --> 00:16:02.730
With love...

00:16:02.820 --> 00:16:04.270
With love...

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:05.740
Through love...

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:06.970
From love...

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:12.590
Attack!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:27.870
Saki!

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.540
Sakuyo... you okay? Were you hurt?

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:37.070
I'm all right. Thanks to your photos...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.040
Huh—Uh, what?

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:41.850
Oh, nothing. Don't sweat it.

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.790
But just let me stay like this for a while..

00:16:45.460 --> 00:16:49.020
The power of your pecs will heal me.

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:52.380
Do my pecs have healing power?

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:54.860
Oh, they do. So much.

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:56.950
Hey, show a little mercy!

00:17:01.060 --> 00:17:03.080
Hey... where are you taking him?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:07.860
We're putting him in fairy world custody.

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:10.730
He'll never return to the human world.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.080
We'll be good to him.

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.860
He didn't do any lasting harm, after all.

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:21.260
If you look at it as a performance, 
it was quite skillfully arranged.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.720
If not for you and Mohiro-chan...

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.150
I couldn't have done anything.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.060
That's not true.

00:17:31.060 --> 00:17:33.550
You're the one who saved his heart.

00:17:33.850 --> 00:17:36.480
You and your tears.

00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:37.910
Get in there.

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:40.170
Push me in a little more gently, okay?

00:17:40.170 --> 00:17:41.350
Manager!

00:17:42.260 --> 00:17:45.240
We're going to become the real thing!

00:17:46.900 --> 00:17:48.740
I'll be looking forward to it.

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:51.500
And then, just once...

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:54.360
Could I get a handshake of my own?

00:18:06.110 --> 00:18:07.400
Thank you!

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:12.530
Goodbye. I'll be rooting for you!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:31.080
Let's go home.

00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:38.610
<i>"I love you, I love you,"</i>

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:32.500
Yeah.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:46.090
<i>cries the crow.</i>

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:54.620
<i>Go to the mountain,</i>

00:18:55.230 --> 00:19:00.760
<i>and see their old nests.</i>

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:11.300
<i>You'll find her sweet children</i>

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:18.170
<i>with their big, round eyes.</i>

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:24.860
I love you! Oh, you!

00:19:24.860 --> 00:19:27.990
I can do anything!

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:31.010
Let's go, let's go! Just watch!

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:33.230
That's my "Honeyed Flash!"

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:36.520
I can change!

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.160
<b>CD on sale!!</b>

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.160
<b>Flash Concert</b>

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.160
<b>Magical Twins</b>

00:19:36.860 --> 00:19:42.160
Magical Twins' 
CD for sale

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:41.220
Everyone! Thanks for coming today.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:46.060
We didn't sell a single CD!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:48.200
Your dancing just sucks!

00:19:48.200 --> 00:19:49.490
No, it doesn't.

00:19:49.490 --> 00:19:51.870
Stop being so honest all the time!

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:57.880
But the retirement of the magical girl 
idols sure caused a commotion...

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.800
<b>Magical Girl Ore's Sudden Retirement!!</b>

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.800
Magical Girl Ore signed fax 
from agency to media outlets

00:19:57.880 --> 00:20:00.430
You sure you don't regret it?

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.420
Ore & Sakigasuki

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.420
<b>Magical Girls 
Quit!</b>

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:06.300
I feel like it's all the more reason I have 
to catch up to my magical girl self...

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:09.310
I made a promise to our manager, too.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.320
Gotcha.

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:13.590
Excuse me!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.260
I'll take one!

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.220
Thank you so much!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.210
Good grief...

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.590
Magical Girls disbanded.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:31.110
I wonder where Ore-san went.

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:35.690
Well, you remember how 
we transformed, don't you?

00:20:35.690 --> 00:20:40.240
What if Ore-san was really 
just someone like us?

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:42.980
No way!

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:44.840
It's possible, though!

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:48.840
Is that what my first love was?!

00:20:49.210 --> 00:20:51.260
You never even realized it before now?

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:53.150
Dummy! You're so freaking cute!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:55.200
I'll buy you another drink!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:02.330
See? One of those girls could be Ore-san!

00:21:02.330 --> 00:21:04.120
No way!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:07.630
And I'm done crying for today!

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:10.100
I want you! Oh, you!

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:11.420
This signal...

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.500
I can do anything!

00:21:11.420 --> 00:21:13.480
There's punks causing trouble in Ni-chome.

00:21:13.980 --> 00:21:15.360
Hey, let's get goin'!

00:21:15.980 --> 00:21:17.430
But we're in the middle of our concert!

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:20.220
Magical girls can't quit that easy!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:22.500
Besides, check out who's 
bein' roughed up.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:25.550
Mohiro-chan again?!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:30.940
I'm startin' to think that guy was 
born under an unlucky star.

00:21:30.940 --> 00:21:32.260
I guess we'd better hurry!

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:33.050
Yeah!

00:21:33.050 --> 00:21:35.190
Wait for me!

00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:38.020
C'mon, buddy...

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:02.130
Magical Girl Ore is here!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:39.920
Illustration: Monokubo
